    {
        "id": 5,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Looks like you had a rough time as well.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Looks like you had a rough time as well."
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Madam Ch'en, what happened here?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Madam Ch'en, what happened here?"
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   We were ambushed by Reunion.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "We were ambushed by Reunion."
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   We were caught in a withering assault with no reinforcements. They easily routed our forces.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "We were caught in a withering assault with no reinforcements. They easily routed our forces."
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   And Misha...?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "And Misha...?"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   She was taken away by a woman dressed in red.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "She was taken away by a woman dressed in red."
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   I really should have...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "I really should have..."
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  ...?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...?"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Nevermind.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Nevermind."
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Madam Ch'en, why is Misha so special?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Madam Ch'en, why is Misha so special?"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   If you keep hiding things from us, it's only going to be harder and harder for us to continue working together.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "If you keep hiding things from us, it's only going to be harder and harder for us to continue working together."
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   I have no obligation to tell you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "I have no obligation to tell you."
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But Rhodes Island has an obligation to understand the objectives and prepare our strategies accordingly.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But Rhodes Island has an obligation to understand the objectives and prepare our strategies accordingly."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Naturally, we'll continue to follow the L.G.D.'s instructions during our operations...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Naturally, we'll continue to follow the L.G.D.'s instructions during our operations..."
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   However, when it comes to using the Infected to fight other Infected, we need all the information we can get.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "However, when it comes to using the Infected to fight other Infected, we need all the information we can get."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   While you may have that information, you don't have the means of using it effectively to reduce your losses.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "While you may have that information, you don't have the means of using it effectively to reduce your losses."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   On the other hand, we have the ability to stop Reunion, but we don't know what they're after.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "On the other hand, we have the ability to stop Reunion, but we don't know what they're after."
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   You sounded a bit like that doctor just now.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "You sounded a bit like that doctor just now."
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#6\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Is, is that so...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Is, is that so..."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I think...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I think..."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   This is something that is equally important to both of us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "This is something that is equally important to both of us."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   I see.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "I see."
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   If it's because you need to ask for permission from Chief Wei...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "If it's because you need to ask for permission from Chief Wei..."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   When we investigated Misha, the most prominent bit of information was that her father was one of Chernobog's most influential people.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "When we investigated Misha, the most prominent bit of information was that her father was one of Chernobog's most influential people."
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Misha's father?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Misha's father?"
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Naturally, we don't know how much Misha knows about Chernobog.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Naturally, we don't know how much Misha knows about Chernobog."
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   She could know nothing, or she could know everything.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "She could know nothing, or she could know everything."
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Nobody knows...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Nobody knows..."
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   ...except her.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "...except her."
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   We also have no idea what kind of information she might have.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "We also have no idea what kind of information she might have."
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Since you predicted that Lungmen would be Reunion's next target...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Since you predicted that Lungmen would be Reunion's next target..."
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   It's obvious that we have to prevent Reunion from using Chernobog.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "It's obvious that we have to prevent Reunion from using Chernobog."
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   That's why we can't allow them to have Misha.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "That's why we can't allow them to have Misha."
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   We were aware of the fact that someone who fit her descriptions had taken refuge in Lungmen...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "We were aware of the fact that someone who fit her descriptions had taken refuge in Lungmen..."
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   But until you actually found her, we weren't able to verify if that intel was accurate.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "But until you actually found her, we weren't able to verify if that intel was accurate."
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   If that's the case, we can't waste any more time.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "If that's the case, we can't waste any more time."
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   We have to stop Reunion and rescue Misha before they're able to take her back to Chernobog!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We have to stop Reunion and rescue Misha before they're able to take her back to Chernobog!"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Rhodes Island, prepare to move out!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Rhodes Island, prepare to move out!"
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   It was the L.G.D.'s responsibility to track her down.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "It was the L.G.D.'s responsibility to track her down."
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   ...and letting Reunion capture her was a dereliction of our duties.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "...and letting Reunion capture her was a dereliction of our duties."
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Rather than lauching a joint operation, we'll need Rhodes Island to eliminate other threats from Reunion.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Rather than lauching a joint operation, we'll need Rhodes Island to eliminate other threats from Reunion."
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   This is an order.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "This is an order."
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...Understood.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...Understood."
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Don't let me down.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Don't let me down."
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=1, initr=2, r=0, g=0, b=0, fadetime=0.8, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "1,",
        "initr": "2,",
        "r": "0,",
        "g": "0,",
        "b": "0,",
        "fadetime": "0.8,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[Character(fadetime=0)]",
        "type": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=0, fadetime=0.8, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "0,",
        "fadetime": "0.8,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   N-no! D-don't beat me...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "N-no! D-don't beat me..."
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   You should've thought twice before entering Lungmen!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "You should've thought twice before entering Lungmen!"
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Aaaagh!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Aaaagh!"
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Lock them all up!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Lock them all up!"
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=1, r=0, g=0, b=0, fadetime=0.1, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "1,",
        "r": "0,",
        "g": "0,",
        "b": "0,",
        "fadetime": "0.1,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[Character(fadetime=0)]",
        "type": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=0, fadetime=0.1, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "0,",
        "fadetime": "0.1,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   They're not with this group of Infected. Curses...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "They're not with this group of Infected. Curses..."
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Not with this group either... Damn it all...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Not with this group either... Damn it all..."
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_015_lmg\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[name=\"L.G.D. Agent\"]   They... retreated way too quickly...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "content": "They... retreated way too quickly..."
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_015_lmg\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   It seems that Reunion also has its own hierarchy.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "It seems that Reunion also has its own hierarchy."
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   They just left the riffraff behind to buy them more time.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "They just left the riffraff behind to buy them more time."
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   To think that a single person could delay our reinforcements...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "To think that a single person could delay our reinforcements..."
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]   Just who are they...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Just who are they..."
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_015_lmg\", name2=\"char_010_chen_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[name=\"L.G.D. Agent\"]   Madam! We found some Reunion stragglers over there!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "content": "Madam! We found some Reunion stragglers over there!"
    },
    {
